OL,3,AFires break out at French schools as
OL,4,Astudents protest nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FFires have broken out at several
OL,7,Fschools in France, as students protest
OL,8,Fby blockading education institutions
OL,9,Fnationwide over school funding and
OL,10,Fstudying conditions.
OL,12,FBlazes were reported at two high
OL,13,Fschools in Nantes, western France,
OL,14,Fwhile another was filmed engulfing the
OL,15,Fentrance to another in the northern
OL,16,Fcity of Rouen.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
